{"id":"d_main_09af_04","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch9","label":"Chapter 9 · Secret"},"label":"The Detective's Reasoning","stage":null,"prev":"d_main_09af_03","next":"d_main_09af_05","speakers":{"novel":"Novel","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","rapi":"Rapi","Narration":"Narration"},"icons":{"novel":"si_c212_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","Narration":"si_c999_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_09af_04_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_1","text":"Exia sent me a message a few hours ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_sunnycarnival","movie":null,"shown":["novel","neon","anis","rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_2","text":"It's a lengthy ciphertext.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_3","text":"The code is extremely advanced, nearly indecipherable, as a matter of fact. However, I wouldn't let it get the best of me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_4","text":"I poured through ancient text, referring to all kinds of various codes and interpretations. All the while, I relied on my sleuthing skills.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_5","text":"After some time, the code, which had previously seemed indecipherable, began to unveil itself, bit by bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_6","text":"In the end, I was finally able to figure out what the code was.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_7","text":"The code is based on ACTV-X. It was infamous back in the day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_8","text":"Listen, we haven't got all day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_9","text":"Ouch...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_10","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_11","text":"So mean...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_12","text":"You can explain the rest to us later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_13","text":"I knew you would have an insatiable thirst for knowledge! The thrill of unraveling a mystery!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_14","text":"I can't say the same for everyone, though. I suppose it's a misconception that everyone has a desire for knowledge.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_15","text":"Knowledge should only be given to those who desire it, I realize that now. I'm another step further to becoming a better detective!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_16","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_17","text":"Erm...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_18","text":"All right, all right, I'll pass along the information I received from Exia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_19","text":"\"Vapaus brings an end to a Nikke's immortality.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_20","text":"What is that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_mystery","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_21","text":"\"It destroys the nanomachines in the Nikke's brain and frees them from the bondage of immortality.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_22","text":"That's all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"novel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_23","text":"I can't make heads or tails out of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_24","text":"There are nanomachines in our brain?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09af_04_25","text":"First time I've heard of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_09af_04_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_09a